		LIGHTS
        =======================

		Overrides for lights should be added along with your normal livery overrides above, just as you would with your wheel rim overrides or number plates.
		Examples of the textures used on the base cars are included in the template download sorted by available texture name.
		               
						Available textures: 
                        LIGHTDIFF   - Light diff texture for auxiliary lights e.g rear weather lights, LED's etc
									- 1024 x 512
                                    - DXT1 with MIPs
									
				        LIGHTSPEC 	- Light spec map texture for auxiliary lights e.g rear weather lights, LED's etc							
									- 1024 x 512
                                    - DXT5 with MIPs	
									
						LIGHTGLOW  	- Light glow texture for auxiliary lights e.g rear weather lights, LED's etc
									- 1024 x 512
                                    - DXT5 with MIPs
									
						GLASSDIFF	- Head light glass diff texture
									- 256 x 128
                                    - DXT5 with MIPs
									
						GLASSGLOW	- Head light glass glow texture
									- 256 x 128
                                    - DXT1 with MIPs
									
						GLASSGLOW2	- Head light glass reflection texture
